dReadyToStartContainers   True \n  Initialized                 True \n  Ready                       False \n  ContainersReady             False \n  PodScheduled                True \nVolumes:\n  url-shorten-mongodb-config:\n    Type:      ConfigMap (a volume populated by a ConfigMap)\n    Name:      url-shorten-mongodb\n    Optional:  false\n  kube-api-access-dsjvh:\n    Type:                    Projected (a volume that contains injected data from multiple sources)\n    TokenExpirationSeconds:  3607\n    ConfigMapName:           kube-root-ca.crt\n    Optional:                false\n    DownwardAPI:             true\nQoS Class:                   BestEffort\nNode-Selectors:              <none>\nTolerations:                 node.kubernetes.io/not-ready:NoExecute op=Exists for 300s\n                             node.kubernetes.io/unreachable:NoExecute op=Exists for 300s\nEvents:\n  Type     Reason     Age                   From               Message\n  ----     ------     ----                  ----               -------\n  Normal   Scheduled  2m20s                 default-scheduler  Successfully assigned social-network/url-shorten-mongodb-ccd7bb58d-nbvbw to node0.htliang2-agent.insai-pg0.apt.emulab.net\n  Normal   Pulled     50s (x5 over 2m19s)   kubelet            spec.containers{url-shorten-mongodb}: Container image "docker.io/library/mongo:4.4.6" already present on machine\n  Normal   Created    49s (x5 over 2m17s)   kubelet            spec.containers{url-shorten-mongodb}: Created container: url-shorten-mongodb\n  Normal   Started    48s (x5 over 2m17s)   kubelet            spec.containers{url-shorten-mongodb}: Started container url-shorten-mongodb\n  Warning  BackOff    46s (x10 over 2m14s)  kubelet            spec.containers{url-shorten-mongodb}: Back-off restarting failed container url-shorten-mongodb in pod url-shorten-mongodb-ccd7bb58d-nbvbw_social-network(d6b4b206-41fc-4140-8716-6ce13c857575)\n\n', id='97d832df-ee2e-43ad-b96a-b24a0b8ef282', tool_call_id='chatcm